{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30278","headline":"送薛耽先辈归谒汉南 · 薛逢","name":"送薛耽先辈归谒汉南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云绕千峰驿路长，谢家联句待檀郎。\n手持碧落新攀桂，月在东轩旧选牀。\n几日旌幢延骏马，到时冰玉动华堂。\n孔门多少风流处，不遣颜回识醉乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30278.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30278","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}